      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Start here\nGreen means healthy; red means down or above a limit. Open **Alerting → Alert rules** for current problems. Login audit entries show the account email and success/failure only; passwords are never recorded. Use **Explore → Loki** to search logs by `service_name`. Alerts are visible in Grafana only; if EC2 or Grafana itself stops, no external notification can be sent.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
